                     Contains Pfam match to entry PF00012 HSP70, Hsp70 protein
                     and matches to Prosite entries PS00329 Heat shock hsp70
                     proteins family signature 2 and PS01036 Heat shock hsp70
                     proteins family signature 3. Contains also possible
                     colied-coli region at aprox. residues 388..402;
                     SCH35.53, DnaK, heat shock protein 70, len: >135aa;
                     previously sequenced therefore identical to SW:DNAK_STRCO.
                     Contains Prosite match to PS00297 Heat shock hsp70
                     proteins family signature 1."
