                     Similar to others from S.coelicolor e.g. TR:O54149
                     (EMBL:AL021409) probable 3-oxoacyl-[acyl-carrier-protein]
                     synthase (407 aa) (39.1% identity in 419 aa overlap).
                     Contains Pfam match to entry PF00109 ketoacyl-synt,
                     Beta-ketoacyl synthase and PS00606 Beta-ketoacyl synthases
                     active site"
