                     Z-score: 1340.7 bits: 258.7 E(): 4.8e-67; 41.074% identity
                     in 689 aa overlap. Contains PS00397 Site-specific
                     recombinases active site and Pfam match to entry
                     recombinase PF00239, Site-specific recombinases, score
                     36.16. The last part of this ORF (aa 672 onwards) appears
                     to be a continuation of SC2E1.21, which was interrupted by
                     the prophage; the similarities to YX27_MYCTU MTCY274.27c
                     (389 aa) (fasta scores; opt: 246 z-score: 225.9 E():
                     2.4e-05, 38.8% identity in 116 aa overlap) continue after
